msgid "[FAQ — Belgium](faq.md) — short answers on the Katz, the MDA, the eAgreement, the eFact and Belgian billing."
msgstr "[FAQ — België](faq.md) — korte antwoorden over de Katz, de MDA, de eAgreement, de eFact en de Belgische facturatie."

